+  `debug_exception_log_level = :error`, `log_file_size`, and default headers
+  without `X-Download-Options`. SQLite databases switched to WAL journaling.
+* Fixes that work on both Rails 7.2 and 8.1: wiki heading anchors computed
+  with the HTML4 sanitizer (`ApplicationHelper#heading_text`: the HTML5 one
+  changed the anchors of headings with non-breaking spaces),
+  `ApplicationController.model_object` stored in `model_object_class`, the
