+
+## 2 releases ago: Rails 7.0 on its framework defaults
+
+* Rails 7.0.8.7 on Ruby 3.2.9, `config.load_defaults 7.0`, `Gemfile.next` on
+  Rails 7.2.4 for CI.
+* It wrote what Rails 6.1 read, with two rollback overrides:
+  `cache_format_version = 6.1` and `cookies_serializer = :hybrid` (writes
+  JSON, reads the Marshal cookies of Rails 6.1). Keys derived with SHA256,
