+* Other overrides introduced: `belongs_to_required_by_default = false`,
+  `forgery_protection_origin_check = false`, `raise_on_open_redirects = false`
+  (now `action_on_open_redirect = :log`), `deliver_later_queue_name = :mailers`,
+  `preload_links_header = false`. Adopted then: per-form and urlsafe CSRF
+  tokens, GCM/SHA256/metadata cookies, `cookies_same_site_protection = :lax`,
+  `default_enforce_utf8 = false`, `button_to_generates_button_tag`,
+  `apply_stylesheet_media_default = false`, `wrap_parameters_by_default`,
+  `partial_inserts = false`, `has_many_inversing`, `automatic_scope_inversing`,
